        "read": true,
        "user_title": "Chief Justice",
        "title_is_group": false,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Official Rule Time!</strong></span></p><p>1) Push is not optional, and must be the number specified in the ability; i.e., \"Push 3\" must always Push the target 3 hexes, not 1 or 2. However, as Humble-Knight mentioned, you can make any Push beyond 1 end on the original space if you move people the right way.</p><p>2) Push is separate from damage. If Proletariat attacks a target and deals no damage, that target is still Pushed.</p><p>3) Characters are immune to the effects of their attacks. This includes damage, which is the most common case, as well as effects like Push. TL;DR - Proletariat cannot Push Proletariat.</p>",
